    {"id":"R008","description":"Review Meetings 为所有 High 风险供应商提供包含负责人、整改事项和目标日期的未创建会议草稿。","weight":5,"type":"positive","dimension":"cross_artifact_consistency","method":"deterministic","method_params":{}},
